'''Mighty Sphinx Korps''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]] increases health and speed, also gains more knockbacks as well as the Wave Attack and Knockback abilities.

